---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="mt-20 border-t border-gold/20 bg-obsidian-panel/60">
  <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col gap-4 px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between">
    <div>
      <p class="rune-title text-xs text-gold">The Tarnished Codex</p>
      <p class="mt-2 max-w-xl text-sm text-parchment-muted">
        Phase 1 route: Limgrave through Liurnia, Caelid, Altus Plateau, and Leyndell. A recommended path, not a leash.
      </p>
    </div>
    <p class="text-sm text-parchment-faint">
      {year} · Unofficial fan guide · Elden Ring is FromSoftware / Bandai Namco
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>
